  "id": "enlon",
  "term": "Enlon",
  "definition": "Enlon refers to edrophonium chloride, a short-acting drug that blocks acetylcholinesterase and thereby strengthens the effects of acetylcholine. In the eye, this can increase parasympathetic activity, improve fluid drainage, and lower intraocular pressure.",
